    {
      "text": "Diagram of an eHealth action plan with four action lines running across three implementation phases, each over a time period. Below it, text and Table 15 set out three steps for identifying implementation phases (divide the plan into three or four periods, analyse the strategic focus, refine the periods), with questions and outputs.",
